  A genuine mispricing population is roughly BALANCED between
  sum > $1 and sum < $1. A strong positive skew is the classic
  betting-market OVERROUND: every leg printing at the ask.
  -> 92.5% positive is a MARKED skew. Treat the
     last-trade deviation as contaminated by the ask side.

